## Regular Expressions - Result will come as true and false ##
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

** Note --> Refer String_+_Regex Folder to know more **
-----------------------------------------------------------

String s = "s";

// [] - use for match a single character
System.out.println(s.matches("[s]"));   //true

// single character between range a-z
System.out.println(s.matches("[a-z]"));  //true

// single character can be in range
System.out.println(s.matches("[a-zA-Z0-9]"));  //true


